[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Backend requirements
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirement

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Requirements for the FastAPI backend and web admin in ``backend/``. Verifications live in ``docs/verifications/backend/``.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Dashboard API

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dashboard change token
STATEMENT: >>>
``GET /api/dashboard/etag`` shall return a value that changes whenever data shown on the dashboard changes: creating, editing, reordering, moving, completing or deleting tasks, creating, editing or deleting agenda items, and changing a person's profile.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The wall tablet only reloads its data when this value changes.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dashboard range limit
STATEMENT: >>>
``GET /api/dashboard`` shall accept date ranges of up to 12 weeks (83 days) and shall reject longer ranges with HTTP 400.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
